*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0028
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-08-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 101
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0028.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    *> AVERAGE MONTHLY BALANCE
    05 AVG-BALANCE        PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 FEE-WAIVER-FLG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVER-FLG=" FEE-WAIVER-FLG
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'G'
       OR ACCT-TYP = 'P'
       OR AVG-BALANCE >= 2500.00
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE
        MOVE 10 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-IF.
